== A. are binding (attachment) stitches covered by the same-section direction check?
  REJECTED  row 2 = sc in stitch 4, then ordinary sc in 1,2,3 (wrong way) -> r2 翻面后的来源顺序须沿上一行反向工作，不能分段跳回
  ACCEPTED  row 2 = sc in stitch 4, then ATTACHING slst in 1,2,3 (same wrong way)
== B. md_safe on block-level Markdown
   '# 已通过实钩验证' -> '# 已通过实钩验证'
   '![x](http://127.0.0.1:9/a.png)' -> '!\\[x\\](http://127.0.0.1:9/a.png)'
   '第一行\n# 伪造标题' -> '第一行\n# 伪造标题'
   '> 引用\n- 列表 **粗体**' -> '&gt; 引用\n- 列表 **粗体**'
